  "content": "\n\n<h1>更多附魔資訊</h1>\n<p>為 JEI 新增附魔資訊\n<img src=\"https://github.com/SettingDust/MoreEnchantmentInfo/raw/refs/heads/main/img.png\" alt=\"img.png\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/SettingDust/MoreEnchantmentInfo/raw/refs/heads/main/img_1.png\" alt=\"img_1.png\"></p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>支援附魔說明</li>\n<li>附魔屬性，例如可交易、可發現、分類、稀有度等。</li>\n<li>適用物品</li>\n<li>附魔衝突</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>鳴謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fjowys-8x8-classic_style_items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/jowys-8x8-classic_style_items</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funfaithful-8x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/unfaithful-8x</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftiny-pixels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/tiny-pixels</a></li>\n</ul>",
